{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_943.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"4d2f314462fde663b8b2f2dcad085a66daf822c5dd6249c661960d670d88f170","ja":"可憐、聞いた？　なんか響たちが、\nクッキング大運動会の続編を始めたって！","zh":"可怜，听说了吗？好像响她们，\n要开始烹饪大运动会的续篇了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_943.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"c248e5bbd1155a21cf7f9e72f6d584e2de83357422b89b8d55546dd5285590b9","ja":"え？　続編……また、お料理をするんですか？\nつ、次は……何をつくろうかな♪","zh":"咦？续篇……又要做饭了吗？\n下、下次……做点什么好呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_943.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c81ea8cfff31f78524e849ede466dbee713205739d645df18de32937c41611c0","ja":"いやいや、それが違うんだ。","zh":"不不，不是那样的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_943.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"654d2bb03fe4afef89c1a942967f7dc01d73d5e5cf6fed7e7543c5e88ad7d060","ja":"料理は作るんだけど、なんか運動しながら\nやるんだって。踊りながら、とか。","zh":"她确实会做菜，但好像都是边运动边做的。\n比如边跳舞边做之类的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_943.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"c668dcf5ca6740e15e537ac5d9593b32b4ce11ef287ace68f9517e83bdcb4fc8","ja":"お、踊りながら、ですか？\n難しそう……。","zh":"哦，边跳舞边做吗？\n看起来好难……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_943.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5f0836508c51e6224138d92ddeb4560aa58e726bc04165e21a0864b69b2c9132","ja":"でも、面白そうじゃん♪　なあ可憐、アタシと\n組んでやろうぜ！　レッツダンシン♪","zh":"不过，好像很有意思嘛♪　喂，可憐，和我\n搭档吧！　一起跳舞吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_943.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"c9d063c28172b623a632d81853ef7133bc63c021e0300e9bf70d882174b068d7","ja":"わ、私なんかでよければ……。踊りながら……\nえ、えっと。パンをこねる……とか？","zh":"我、如果是我这种人也行的话……。一边跳舞……\n呃、那个。揉面团……之类的？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_943.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"22214906997c56e238e3479bbbfe984cc1e82e085a0a4c273cb41d3232ac0523","ja":"それいいじゃん！\nよーし、ミュージックスタート！","zh":"那不错啊！\n好，音乐开始！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_943.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"2a9c8e24c455a8a66b912bda55efa572c1c562771f03539f91cf1fbf786020f3","ja":"ぐるぐるこねこね、ぐるぐるこねこね♪","zh":"咕噜咕噜揉啊揉，咕噜咕噜揉啊揉♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_943.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"fd671257eca4e67b93322995ddf2c479d5cc37f9170082374d03b22ea64bcd78","ja":"え、えーと……ぐるぐる、こねこね……。\nぐるぐる、こねこね……","zh":"呃、那个……搅啊搅，揉啊揉……。\n搅啊搅，揉啊揉……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
