{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_943.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"b833259fa1a4338f1530bd962657ae8603ee5d608aae726cceaaf6dbce162482","ja":"マイガ―！　可憐、大丈夫かー！？","zh":"我的天！可怜，你没事吧——！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_943.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"5bc86cbfe523638a0251d4d49b618d5e4ce8a5e4eea620d2d0c6a24961cdef0c","ja":"（ふっふっふ。歩たちは脱落したみたい。今のところ\n自分が暫定一位だね！　この調子で優勝するさー！）","zh":"（哼哼哼。舞浜她们好像被淘汰了。目前\n我是暂定第一名！照这个势头下去，我要夺冠啦——！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
